## Advanced: JSON Manifest

Define injections declaratively in `site.json` alongside pages:

```json
{
  "site": { "title": "My App" },
  "injections": [
    {
      "target": "#user-widget",
      "fetch": {
        "url": "/api/user",
        "saveAs": "currentUser"
      },
      "loading": {
        "type": "html",
        "content": "<p>Loading...</p>"
      },
      "block": {
        "type": "html",
        "content": "<div>Welcome, {{state.currentUser.name}}!</div>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "pages": [...]
}
```

Injections process automatically on `Render.init()` or call `Render.processInjections()` manually.

